@budget tool_args max=2304 : live TS arg describe() bytes, irToolDescription-region only (feature_kb_akb: +1 tool pushed budget 1536→1792; feature_039/meta_harness_concurrent: +1 tool omt_net pushed 1792→2048; feature_040: omt_net splice args (mode/mutation/subnet/feature) pushed 2048→2304)
@budget nav_index max=64000 : nav.index.jsonl bytes — on-demand nav answers (improvement006/OPT-D: the largest projection was unchecked)
